    "A bold headline across the top reads \"NORTHBOUND COFFEE\". Anything not quoted comes back as scribble.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine fette Überschrift oben liest sich „NORTHBOUND COFFEE“. Alles, was nicht in Anführungszeichen steht, kommt als Gekritzel zurück."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bold headline across the top reads \"NORTHBOUND COFFEE\". Anything not quoted comes back as scribble."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un titular en negrita en la parte superior dice «NORTHBOUND COFFEE». Todo lo que no esté entre comillas vuelve como garabato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un gros titre en haut affiche « NORTHBOUND COFFEE ». Tout ce qui n’est pas entre guillemets revient sous forme de gribouillis."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un titolo in grassetto in alto recita \"NORTHBOUND COFFEE\". Tutto ciò che non è tra virgolette torna come uno scarabocchio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上部の太字の見出しには「NORTHBOUND COFFEE」と書かれています。引用符で囲まれていないものは落書きとして出力されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "위쪽의 굵은 헤드라인에는 \"NORTHBOUND COFFEE\"라고 쓰여 있습니다. 따옴표로 감싸지 않은 것은 낙서로 나옵니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um título em negrito no topo diz \"NORTHBOUND COFFEE\". Qualquer coisa que não esteja entre aspas volta como rabisco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顶部的粗体标题写着“NORTHBOUND COFFEE”。没有加引号的内容会变成潦草的涂鸦。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "頂部的粗體標題寫著「NORTHBOUND COFFEE」。沒有加引號的內容會變成潦草的塗鴉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single glossy red ceramic teapot with a bamboo handle, seen in three-quarter view, its lid slightly ajar, a soft highlight running down the left of the body and the shadow of the spout falling across it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine einzelne glänzende rote Keramik-Teekanne mit Bambusgriff, gesehen in Dreiviertelansicht, der Deckel leicht geöffnet, ein sanftes Glanzlicht, das die linke Seite des Korpus hinabläuft, und der Schatten der Tülle, der darüberfällt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A single glossy red ceramic teapot with a bamboo handle, seen in three-quarter view, its lid slightly ajar, a soft highlight running down the left of the body and the shadow of the spout falling across it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una sola tetera de cerámica roja y brillante con asa de bambú, vista en tres cuartos, con la tapa ligeramente entreabierta, un suave reflejo que recorre el lado izquierdo del cuerpo y la sombra del pico cayendo sobre ella."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une seule théière en céramique rouge brillante avec une anse en bambou, vue en trois quarts, son couvercle légèrement entrouvert, un doux reflet descendant le long du côté gauche du corps et l’ombre du bec tombant sur elle."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una singola teiera di ceramica rossa lucida con manico di bambù, vista in tre quarti, con il coperchio leggermente socchiuso, un morbido riflesso che scende lungo il lato sinistro del corpo e l’ombra del beccuccio che vi cade sopra."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竹製の持ち手が付いた、艶のある赤い陶器のティーポットが一つ。アングルは斜め四十五度、蓋はわずかに開き、柔らかいハイライトが胴の左側を伝い、注ぎ口の影がそこに落ちている。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "대나무 손잡이가 달린 광택 있는 빨간 도자기 찻주전자 하나. 각도는 사분의 삼 각도이며, 뚜껑은 살짝 열려 있고, 부드러운 하이라이트가 몸통 왼쪽을 타고 흐르며, 주둥이의 그림자가 그 위에 드리워져 있다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um único bule de cerâmica vermelha brilhante com cabo de bambu, visto em três quartos, com a tampa levemente entreaberta, um brilho suave descendo pelo lado esquerdo do corpo e a sombra do bico caindo sobre ele."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一把有光泽的红色陶瓷茶壶，配竹制手柄，从四十五度角看去，壶盖微微开启，一道柔和的高光顺着壶身左侧流下，壶嘴的影子落在上面。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一把有光澤的紅色陶瓷茶壺，配竹製把手，從四十五度角看去，壺蓋微微開啟，一道柔和的高光順著壺身左側流下，壺嘴的影子落在上面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wide realistic photograph of <subject>, <background and palette>. In the centre of the frame, <what fills it>. On the left side, <what sits there>. On the right, <what sits there>. Across the lower third, <foreground>. A <weight, colour> line across the top reads \"<exact words>\". The lighting is <source, direction, quality>, leaving <shadows>. The overall composition is <balance>, <palette>, <mood>.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine breite realistische Fotografie von <Motiv>, <Hintergrund und Farbpalette>. In der Mitte des Bildes <was es ausfüllt>. Auf der linken Seite <was dort steht>. Auf der rechten Seite <was dort steht>. Im unteren Drittel <Vordergrund>. Eine <Stärke, Farbe> Linie oben liest sich „<genauer Wortlaut>“. Das Licht ist <Quelle, Richtung, Qualität> und hinterlässt <Schatten>. Die Gesamtkomposition ist <Balance>, <Farbpalette>, <Stimmung>."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A wide realistic photograph of <subject>, <background and palette>. In the centre of the frame, <what fills it>. On the left side, <what sits there>. On the right, <what sits there>. Across the lower third, <foreground>. A <weight, colour> line across the top reads \"<exact words>\". The lighting is <source, direction, quality>, leaving <shadows>. The overall composition is <balance>, <palette>, <mood>."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una amplia fotografía realista de <sujeto>, <fondo y paleta>. En el centro del encuadre, <qué lo llena>. En el lado izquierdo, <qué hay ahí>. A la derecha, <qué hay ahí>. En el tercio inferior, <primer plano>. Una línea <peso, color> en la parte superior dice «<palabras exactas>». La luz es <fuente, dirección, calidad>, dejando <sombras>. La composición general es <equilibrio>, <paleta>, <ambiente>."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une large photographie réaliste de <sujet>, <arrière-plan et palette>. Au centre du cadre, <ce qui le remplit>. Sur le côté gauche, <ce qui s’y trouve>. À droite, <ce qui s’y trouve>. Sur le tiers inférieur, <premier plan>. Une ligne <épaisseur, couleur> en haut affiche « <mots exacts> ». La lumière est <source, direction, qualité>, laissant <des ombres>. La composition générale est <équilibre>, <palette>, <ambiance>."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un’ampia fotografia realistica di <soggetto>, <sfondo e palette>. Al centro dell’inquadratura, <cosa la riempie>. Sul lato sinistro, <cosa c’è>. A destra, <cosa c’è>. Nel terzo inferiore, <primo piano>. Una linea <peso, colore> in alto recita \"<parole esatte>\". La luce è <fonte, direzione, qualità>, lasciando <ombre>. La composizione generale è <equilibrio>, <palette>, <atmosfera>."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<被写体>の横長でリアルな写真、<背景と配色>。画面の中央には<そこを埋めるもの>。左側には<そこにあるもの>。右側には<そこにあるもの>。下三分の一には<前景>。上部の<太さ、色>の帯が「<正確な言葉>」と書かれている。光は<光源、向き、質>で、<影>を落としている。全体の構図は<バランス>、<配色>、<雰囲気>。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<피사체>의 넓은 사실적인 사진, <배경과 색조>. 화면 중앙에는 <그곳을 채우는 것>. 왼쪽에는 <그곳에 있는 것>. 오른쪽에는 <그곳에 있는 것>. 하단 3분의 1에는 <전경>. 위쪽의 <굵기, 색상> 선에는 \"<정확한 문구>\"라고 쓰여 있다. 조명은 <광원, 방향, 질감>이며, <그림자>를 남긴다. 전체 구도는 <균형>, <색조>, <분위기>다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma fotografia realista panorâmica de <assunto>, <fundo e paleta>. No centro do quadro, <o que o preenche>. No lado esquerdo, <o que está lá>. À direita, <o que está lá>. No terço inferior, <primeiro plano>. Uma linha <peso, cor> no topo diz \"<palavras exatas>\". A luz é <fonte, direção, qualidade>, deixando <sombras>. A composição geral é <equilíbrio>, <paleta>, <clima>."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<主体>的宽幅写实照片，<背景与色调>。画面中央是<填满那里的东西>。左侧是<那里有什么>。右侧是<那里有什么>。下三分之一处是<前景>。顶部一条<粗细、颜色>的线条写着“<确切文字>”。光线<来源、方向、质感>，留下<阴影>。整体构图<平衡>、<色调>、<氛围>。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<主體>的寬幅寫實照片，<背景與色調>。畫面中央是<填滿那裡的東西>。左側是<那裡有什麼>。右側是<那裡有什麼>。下三分之一處是<前景>。頂部一條<粗細、顏色>的線條寫著「<確切文字>」。光線<來源、方向、質感>，留下<陰影>。整體構圖<平衡>、<色調>、<氛圍>。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Across the top, on the left, in the lower third, tucked into the corner. Ten such phrases reach the edges and keep the frame locatable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oben, links, im unteren Drittel, in der Ecke. Zehn solcher Formulierungen erreichen die Ränder und halten das Bild verortbar."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Across the top, on the left, in the lower third, tucked into the corner. Ten such phrases reach the edges and keep the frame locatable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arriba, a la izquierda, en el tercio inferior, metido en la esquina. Diez frases así llegan hasta los bordes y mantienen el encuadre ubicable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En haut, à gauche, dans le tiers inférieur, glissé dans le coin. Dix formules de ce genre atteignent les bords et gardent le cadre repérable."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In alto, a sinistra, nel terzo inferiore, incastrato nell’angolo. Dieci frasi di questo tipo raggiungono i bordi e mantengono l’inquadratura orientabile."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上部に、左に、下三分の一に、隅に寄せて。こうした位置表現を十個ほど使うと、端まで届いて画面の場所が把握しやすくなる。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "위쪽에, 왼쪽에, 하단 3분의 1 지점에, 구석에 붙여서. 이런 표현을 열 개쯤 쓰면 가장자리까지 닿아서 화면의 위치를 가늠할 수 있게 된다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No topo, à esquerda, no terço inferior, encaixado no canto. Dez frases assim alcançam as bordas e mantêm o quadro localizável."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在顶部、在左侧、在下三分之一处、塞进角落里。十个这样的短语能触及边缘，让画面保持可定位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在頂部、在左側、在下三分之一處、塞進角落裡。十個這樣的短語能觸及邊緣，讓畫面保持可定位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
